      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g08_pavilion"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g11_yanroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......黑色的酒盏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那时，那个人用的，是否是这只酒盏呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......李小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杂役",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在！有什么事吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚才来访的客人，记住长相了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杂役",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "记住了......那么大块头的丰蹄老爷，想不记住都难啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你带两盒糕点，去探望一下宁小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "若是在宁小姐那儿见到了那位丰蹄老爷......回来告诉我一声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杂役",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，可您为啥不亲自去——呃......抱歉，我不该问哈，我这就去看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g09_teahouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恩人，我打听好了。咱们沿着这条山路往上，就到会合的地方了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过万一我们真的谁都没见着，到时候可如何是好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就只能回梁府找鲤先生，他说梁知府正委托他调查酒盏的主人，我们也去帮帮忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......如果那个杜小姐说的话是真的，取盏的是位大人物......那位梁知府，真的一无所知？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可如果从头到尾都是谋划，梁知府又何必如此麻烦，演这么大一出戏？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们也不是没见过大人物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那个自称信使的少年郎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈......要是博士在，这些费脑子的事就都能丢给他了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......好想念宿舍里软乎乎的床啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，您说咱们怎么就被牵扯进这样一出事里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......把茶喝完吧，该出发了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风尘仆仆的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风尘仆仆的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "应该是这附近了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急匆匆的伙计",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "开水开水，让一让让一让喽——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急匆匆的伙计",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔！留神！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风尘仆仆的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（雷姆必拓语）——喂！你就非要撞我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风尘仆仆的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风尘仆仆的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......信？是刚才......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g06_mountainroad_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......时间也过了，果然没来啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这可如何是好？也不知道炎熔恩人这会有没有抵达办事处......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咱们再等等？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不然还是先和鲤先生会合——嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘎——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......墨魉！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慢着慢着，这些东西是可以离开那片画卷天地的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小家伙，你从哪里来啊，你的主人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘎啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别咬我啊，松嘴，松嘴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_landscape"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是你先惹它的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿咬，够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好——疼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夕小姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出了点状况，姑且用这种方法和你们见面了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "状况......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别想了，帮不来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们在尚蜀遇到了追查勾吴城灰齐山一事的朝廷特使......自称司岁台。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧......我还以为年那家伙来找我，起码已经打点好了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来我就不该对她为人处世的常识抱什么期待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "动手了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒不至于和官差打起来......哈哈，主要是打不过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然他们是提到了你们姐妹，不过，倒暂时没有深究的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们来到尚蜀，似乎有别的任务。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不知道这件事，你们有什么线索？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "与一只黑色的酒盏有关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......黑色，酒盏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们也在协助一位鲤先生追查酒盏的主人，那盏似乎印着一个图案......很像是年小姐给炎熔恩人的那个物件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "酒盏......难怪我总觉得有什么奇怪的地方，如果猜得不错，这只酒盏的主人一定是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果真能找到她的话，确实能帮上不小的忙。起码，能帮忙堵上年的嘴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夕！快出来！那老头烦死人了，唠唠叨叨，换你去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，这是年小姐的声音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你们听错了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天有洪炉——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要、要不，我们就先不打扰了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你们说，你们本来就在找那只酒盏的主人，对吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比朝廷先一步找到她，说服她，最好让她帮我们一个忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最起码，拖到我们抵达尚蜀，不要让司岁台把她带走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "交给你们了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g06_mountainroad_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唔，回来了......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恩人，夕小姐这玄妙术法，看几次都感觉好方便啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正也不是寻常源石技艺，你就别琢磨了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不过是挺方便的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g05_mountaincity_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......找亭子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想，像您这样的挑夫，山上山下跑过那么多趟，对这片山区，就像自家后院一样了解了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也可以现在就告诉你，三山十七峰，不论是旧时古亭还是刚修建不久的观景凉亭，数不胜数。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想找其中某一个，很困难的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您能做到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "得费不少事儿，何况我也是按趟拿工钱的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天底下总没有白帮人的道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，这是报酬......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......龙门人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。先生怎么称呼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我姓尚。尚且的尚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么帮？要我带路？还是先帮你找到差不多的地方，然后告诉你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "时间紧迫，要是能分头行动，那是最好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你一个外地人，和这个船夫一起？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在江上待过很久，对这附近也算熟悉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "江水不同路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都在尚蜀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......别离峰，梓云峰，青銮峰，不必去了。这三小峰只是被古人算进了十七峰而已，其实和小土丘没多大差别。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，我们今日探寻的重点，其实就在这取江峰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "劳烦日落之前，先生能给些线索......特别是，如果山间哪些小镇有出名酒铺，需要额外留意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "酒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁言亭台不好酒？每逢独卧皆醉人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那我打听打听。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "暂定酉时，就在那里的茶馆见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......回见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你倒是随性，随便抓个人就托人办事，不怕被骗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当侦探嘛。总要背负点风险的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你信得过他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "勉强信得过。他刚才一路走过，不少店家都在和他打招呼，说明他人缘不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一个愿意为了这点小钱就骗我一个外地人的挑夫，不会在这附近有这么好的人缘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且再怎么也比无头苍蝇乱找来得强。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说得也有道理......那我们一会先去哪里？有线索吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一个被咱们知府大人一口咬定在尚蜀地界，但又根本找不着的人，压根不会在这寻常山镇里待着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以问题多半在那只酒盏上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "加上......既然还有人来抢这只名不见经传的酒盏，就更说明，这个物件，才是关键。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慎师傅，你说如果我们又遇到了那晚的贼人，咱俩合计一番，能否协力退敌？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，我安安稳稳在江上待了几十年，唯一忧心的事情就是孙子孙女的学业，没打过架，真遇上贼人，麻烦得很。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就老老实实当个向导，鲤小子，你要是真不放心，我劝你哪，还是早点去找梁大人要两个保镖来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "混江湖的，真能不湿鞋？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在江上这几十年啊，是真没遇见过什么事儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咱们这一路巡山，要是不留神撞着几只野兽，我倒是能保证护你周全......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过这几年大兴土木的，山里哪还有野兽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......野兽不常见，不过，尚蜀可有一种......背上长着金属器皿的生物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那是啥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在哪儿看见的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗷......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "眼前看见的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这......这是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，跑了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是被吓跑的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......有事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "酒盏在你身上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们是郑掌柜的人，掌柜的在这镇子里也有家小餐馆，请你吃顿午饭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g06_mountainroad_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真搞不懂大小姐和掌柜的在搞什么。派个这么麻烦的差事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一会要跟着抢货，一会又要掩护货不被夺走，还要妨碍雇主......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，起来啦，你看那边的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年们",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......站住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这位大哥，有何指教？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......那个......我是来旅游的，结果钱包丢了，人生地不熟的，你能不能帮个忙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你们几位，一起丢的钱包？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不是，是......是大家一起出来玩，懒得背包嘛，就把照相机啊钱包啊放进一个包里了，然后包丢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也不麻烦您啦，能帮我们回山下的酒店，报了警，一定会找机会报答小哥的，麻烦了，帮帮忙吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g02_yanalley_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已经这么晚了......天黑得真早啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小乌有，梁府怎么走来着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这边，恩人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g03_yandowntown_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尚蜀的大街小巷，繁花似锦，走在高楼之上，平视山峦，俯瞰夜市，确实别有一番韵味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......与勾吴城，是截然不同的风景。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊。风景不错，视野也好。最重要的是，能闻到风里夹杂的铁锈气味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的剑许久未曾出鞘，谈何生锈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "找我们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然......罗德岛还是涉事过深了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你已经调查过我们了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "送克洛丝姐姐一个炎国词汇，“法网恢恢”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不问种族，不问出身，不问贫富，对待感染者一视同仁，致力于救助感染者的医疗企业——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——这天底下最清白的天岳山泉，恐怕也没有罗德岛来得清澈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......过奖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......别误会，我并不是在威胁二位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毕竟如果罗德岛真是什么可疑的组织，那恐怕现在，二位已经在牢里等着传唤了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即是说，眼下这个状况，还请二位当作一种“信任”来对待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是不是该说“谢谢”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感染者再怎么也不该正大光明地在闹市区来来往往，多少还是要注意点安全问题的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "随我换个地方吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（怎么办？恩人，这小子明显有诈啊。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不一定，而且我们又没得选......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啊，那就换个地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，那我看两位也身手不凡，一刻钟后，我在北边那座五纺阁楼上，等着二位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这就是你们炎国功夫里所谓的轻功？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算是。当然了，看那位小哥的功夫，也不算什么普通人就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好吧，其实是了不得的身法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很少看你这么严肃哎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，恩人说笑了，我不是时刻严以律己，一丝不苟的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以他的年纪，能有这样的身手......天赋异禀师出名门，那都是低估了的。我看，还是用匪夷所思得当。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就说，能让那个牛大官儿当保镖的公子哥，肯定不是什么软柿子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们明显知道年和夕的事情，自然，也就知道鲤先生的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夕说过......要我们先一步找到那只酒盏的主人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可擅自与大炎官方扯上关系，回头免不了要被阿米娅训一顿啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，要是博士......也不能总麻烦博士啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
